keiko 1
# G2 (recipe G: failed gallery art) — one sprite's PNG is missing and another is
# undecodable, while the background is healthy. Both declared entries stay in
# the gallery, the failed still opens, each failed path logs its sprite row once
# and no Notice appears; the healthy art logs nothing.
# Excluded: the placeholder frame's rendering (contain-fit, outline and the
# still's usability as drawn), and the "no repeat spam on revisit" count — the
# case grammar asserts a line's presence or absence, not how many times it was
# written, so the count is a rule test.
decide ace.greet warm
setting play.text_speed 0

new-game
advance
advance
pick "Ask about the letter"
advance
expect scene reunion
advance
expect line "You came back! I... hoped you would."
expect log warn row 4 contains "sprites/ace/neutral.png"
expect log warn row 4 contains "sprites/ace/happy.png"
expect no-log warn row 3
expect notice none
menu
expect surface menu
press Tab
press Tab
press Tab
press Tab
press Enter
expect surface gallery
expect control gallery.card.1 label "school_gate"
expect control gallery.card.2 label "ace · happy"
expect control gallery.card.3 label "ace · neutral"
activate gallery.card.2
expect surface still
expect notice none
press Escape
expect surface gallery
activate gallery.card.3
expect surface still
press Escape
expect surface gallery
